er wants to secure a new bucket, audit an existing bucket, fix a security finding, configure encryption, or enable logging and monitoring. Do NOT use for general S3 data operations, S3 Tables setup, or discovering existing data assets.\n\n\nServices: s3, kms, cloudtrail, guardduty, config, accessanalyzer\nTasks: secure, audit, remediate, encrypt, monitor\nPersona: developer, security-engineer\nWorkload: storage, compliance\n*","skill_name":"securing-s3-buckets"}]}}"}]}], "label": "Checking AWS docs on Textract AnalyzeDocument S3 permission model"}
